WEBVTT

00:24.710 --> 00:26.340
I...

01:00.160 --> 01:02.000
Fumika?

01:09.510 --> 01:09.760
The true forms

01:11.340 --> 01:11.590
Of the things that I gazed at

01:13.220 --> 01:13.470
Were for showing after I closed my eyes

01:14.300 --> 01:17.180
Shigofumi

01:16.890 --> 01:17.140
Again today, time

01:18.770 --> 01:19.020
Will only construct a loneliness

01:20.560 --> 01:20.810
That seems to be torn apart, right?

01:27.980 --> 01:28.230
There are people who can't forget about

01:31.650 --> 01:31.900
The white lotuses that bloom in the darkness

01:35.280 --> 01:35.530
Nevertheless, recollections

01:39.040 --> 01:39.290
Visit from the future

01:42.710 --> 01:42.960
Words that turn into sighs

01:50.090 --> 01:50.340
Are the emerging wings of the soul

01:53.800 --> 01:54.050
Will I flutter apart?

01:57.510 --> 01:57.760
Growing confused and disordered

02:01.180 --> 02:01.430
I want to carve

02:03.520 --> 02:03.770
These letters to you

02:08.520 --> 02:08.780
Pieces of the truth

02:10.360 --> 02:10.610
Of things that I want to tell you-

02:12.240 --> 02:12.490
I can't even send them well to you

02:15.950 --> 02:16.200
If I write them with the blood that stains my fingertips

02:19.620 --> 02:19.870
Then can they spill into your heart?

02:23.330 --> 02:23.580
Even if the one word left behind

02:26.540 --> 02:26.790
To us who live

02:29.250 --> 02:29.500
Is to be goodbye

02:41.520 --> 02:42.850
Fumika?

02:46.060 --> 02:47.440
Natsuka-...

02:48.230 --> 02:49.190
chan.

02:51.530 --> 02:52.990
Fumika!

02:56.780 --> 02:57.530
Fumika!

03:01.870 --> 03:03.620
Thank God.

03:03.620 --> 03:05.080
Fumika.

03:05.080 --> 03:06.460
Thank God.

03:09.880 --> 03:12.380
Thank God!

03:16.930 --> 03:18.720
Sorry, but please come!

03:19.100 --> 03:22.140
Mikawa Fumika of Room 301 has regained consciousness.

03:22.140 --> 03:23.850
She's awake!

03:27.150 --> 03:29.520
Say, if she regained consciousness...

03:30.980 --> 03:35.820
That gun; the Shigofumi meant for Fumika
is the gun which you shot your father with, right?

03:36.360 --> 03:38.780
What are you planning by giving something like that to her?

03:40.240 --> 03:41.950
I want her to shoot me.

03:46.540 --> 03:47.460
What are you saying?

03:47.750 --> 03:50.290
Fumika is really bad with jokes.

03:50.290 --> 03:52.800
Postal workers are already dead.

03:52.800 --> 03:54.710
You won't die even if she shoots you.

03:55.420 --> 03:56.760
I'm different.

03:58.010 --> 04:01.050
I'm Fumi-chan's alter-ego.

04:01.050 --> 04:03.720
So, if Fumi-chan eliminates me...

04:04.600 --> 04:06.430
it will spell my death.

04:09.060 --> 04:10.690
Are you serious?

04:10.690 --> 04:13.150
Did Mikawa Kirameki's daughter really wake up?

04:13.440 --> 04:16.070
Yes, I just got word from the hospital.

04:16.070 --> 04:20.570
What should we do? We were finally
about to release Kirameki-sensei's new work.

04:20.870 --> 04:24.830
If word gets out of the daughter's abuse,
we definitely won't be able to publish it.

04:27.790 --> 04:30.500
Mikawa Fumika has woken up?

04:31.420 --> 04:32.920
Ah, yes.

04:33.210 --> 04:36.630
I'm not seeing any post-coma disorders at the moment.

04:36.630 --> 04:38.720
Physically, she's healthy as well.

04:38.720 --> 04:41.640
Just that, her memory appears fuzzy at best.

04:41.930 --> 04:43.890
Then, what about the incident in concern?

04:43.890 --> 04:45.850
<i>It doesn't seem like she has any recollection.</i>

04:45.850 --> 04:47.850
<i>But, we shouldn't rush her.</i>

04:47.850 --> 04:51.850
Yes, I'll wait for her to recover
before bringing her in for questioning.

04:52.270 --> 04:54.230
So, what is she doing right now?

04:54.230 --> 04:56.070
<i>She's chatting with her friends.</i>

04:56.360 --> 04:59.320
<i>By chance, her friends just happened to be visiting.</i>

05:00.030 --> 05:02.410
We both went to the same middle school.

05:02.410 --> 05:04.830
Although it was only for half a year.

05:04.830 --> 05:06.910
We first met at the infirmary.

05:07.200 --> 05:10.210
I cut my foot during swim class.

05:12.080 --> 05:16.130
I'm sorry, but I can't recall.

05:18.340 --> 05:21.800
It's okay. Just take your time to remember.

05:23.930 --> 05:27.850
You remembered my name after all, right?

05:40.700 --> 05:42.110
Fumika is going to die?

05:42.410 --> 05:44.240
By "Fumika", you mean...

05:44.240 --> 05:45.700
The postal worker.

05:45.990 --> 05:49.750
She became a postal worker because she wanted to erase herself.

05:49.750 --> 05:52.290
Probably, to atone for her sins.

05:52.290 --> 05:53.250
Sins?

05:53.540 --> 05:58.210
She blames herself for the other
Fumika turning into "Sleeping Beauty".

06:00.880 --> 06:04.260
If Fumi shoots Mika, then her alter-ego will be erased.

06:04.260 --> 06:07.350
That would mean the death of Fumika, the postal worker.

06:07.760 --> 06:09.310
How could she?

06:09.310 --> 06:10.430
We can't let her do that!

06:10.730 --> 06:14.560
There's nothing we can do if that's what Fumika herself desires.

06:14.560 --> 06:17.440
Then, why did you come to us, Chiaki?

06:19.690 --> 06:22.610
You don't want Fumika to disappear either, right?

06:22.950 --> 06:23.950
That's why...

06:26.870 --> 06:29.490
Eh? Wait up, Fumika.

06:29.490 --> 06:31.790
The recipient is on the harbour side.

06:31.790 --> 06:34.170
We'll go after I see Fumi-chan.

06:34.170 --> 06:38.790
We can do that after work, right? Let's do the delivery first.

06:38.790 --> 06:40.340
I feel that I'm being called.

06:41.010 --> 06:42.260
Calling out, "Mika".

06:45.970 --> 06:49.140
It's already late. Let's just do this tomorrow.

06:49.430 --> 06:51.220
Okay, Fumika?

07:00.980 --> 07:02.650
Thank you for the food!

07:05.150 --> 07:05.990
...for the food.

07:08.910 --> 07:10.530
Put the egg shells in here.

07:10.530 --> 07:12.500
Ah, thank you.

07:12.500 --> 07:15.080
Don't be shy and eat as much as you want, okay?

07:15.080 --> 07:15.830
Yeah.

07:15.830 --> 07:19.290
Isn't there an awful lot of meat
today? Is it because we have a guest?

07:19.290 --> 07:22.000
Hey, we're not in the Showa period any more.

07:22.000 --> 07:24.050
I'm kidding. This is standard.

07:24.340 --> 07:26.720
Your jokes are so old-fashioned, Natsuka.

07:26.720 --> 07:31.010
Are those words you can direct to an active high school girl?

07:31.010 --> 07:33.600
Describing yourself as "active" sounds so old-fashioned in itself.

07:33.600 --> 07:35.230
Spot on.

07:36.810 --> 07:39.730
Why are you all ganging up on me? Sheesh.

07:41.270 --> 07:45.360
We managed to prevent those
two from meeting for the time being.

07:45.990 --> 07:46.990
Now...

07:52.740 --> 07:55.160
They took her to another hospital for an examination.

07:55.790 --> 07:57.160
Kaname?

07:58.420 --> 08:00.710
Examination? Don't tell me...

08:00.710 --> 08:02.340
Her condition hasn't changed.

08:02.340 --> 08:04.960
They're just attempting a new treatment.

08:05.260 --> 08:08.800
Don't worry. She'll be back in a week's time or so.

08:09.760 --> 08:10.720
I see.

08:11.640 --> 08:12.180
Huh?

08:15.310 --> 08:18.060
Hey, I was cooking that piece of meat!

08:18.060 --> 08:20.100
Ah, sorry! I wasn't thinking.

08:20.400 --> 08:22.690
Tonight's meat is really great.

08:22.690 --> 08:24.150
Mum must have put in a lot of work.

08:24.150 --> 08:28.110
Oh, you knew? Nothing beats Japanese beef for sukiyaki, right?

08:28.110 --> 08:29.110
What's wrong?

08:32.740 --> 08:35.370
Could this be your first time having sukiyaki?

08:35.370 --> 08:37.080
Eh? Really?

08:39.000 --> 08:40.420
It's real easy!

08:40.420 --> 08:44.630
Just take the food you want,
mix it in with the egg, and eat. That's all.

08:49.260 --> 08:50.010
See?

09:12.030 --> 09:13.370
It's good.

09:15.870 --> 09:17.790
It was a really close call!

09:17.790 --> 09:20.290
Fumika came shortly after you guys left.

09:20.290 --> 09:21.920
<i>You managed to handle the situation?</i>

09:21.920 --> 09:23.080
Yeah, somewhat.

09:23.080 --> 09:25.130
Fumika went to work.

09:25.130 --> 09:26.300
How's it going on your end?

09:26.670 --> 09:29.510
Forcing her to come here was probably the right move.

09:29.510 --> 09:33.590
Fumika had dinner and played with us...

09:33.590 --> 09:35.810
but it seems like she'd never done any of that before.

09:46.610 --> 09:49.320
<i>Really? I guess it turned out for the better then.</i>

09:49.320 --> 09:50.110
Yeah.

09:50.400 --> 09:53.570
But nevertheless, we're just buying time with this.

09:54.910 --> 09:58.330
Chiaki-san said that she had some ideas though.

10:00.790 --> 10:02.500
Please assist us, Risala.

10:02.500 --> 10:05.040
You're well versed with the laws of the Gospel Department, right?

10:05.420 --> 10:07.130
Now this is unusual.

10:07.130 --> 10:09.210
You're asking for help?

10:09.210 --> 10:11.010
That just shows how desperate I am!

10:11.880 --> 10:14.800
Well, I'm not sure if I will help you or not.

10:22.060 --> 10:23.850
But, I'll hear what you have to say.

10:24.600 --> 10:27.770
I'll be in the next room. Just tell me if anything comes up.

10:27.770 --> 10:29.570
You can knock on the wall too.

10:29.570 --> 10:30.320
Yeah.

10:30.320 --> 10:31.400
Okay, night.

10:31.400 --> 10:32.490
Natsuka-chan!

10:32.490 --> 10:33.280
Huh?

10:35.490 --> 10:36.740
Thank you.

10:38.700 --> 10:40.370
You're welcome.

10:44.960 --> 10:47.040
Fumika-chan is adorable, isn't she?

10:47.040 --> 10:49.250
Yeah, I'm glad we brought her here.

10:49.250 --> 10:51.130
She was so delighted.

10:51.420 --> 10:53.880
She's just more childish than she looks.

10:55.470 --> 10:58.720
Say, Sis. After Fumika recovers...

10:58.720 --> 11:01.020
what will happen to her alter-ego?

11:01.560 --> 11:03.350
They would probably become one.

11:04.520 --> 11:05.810
One?

11:07.270 --> 11:10.520
Don't worry. She might be gone on the outside...

11:10.820 --> 11:13.820
but she'll always be inside her, I guess.

11:24.120 --> 11:26.120
Shigofumi

11:27.170 --> 11:29.170
Shigofumi

11:31.050 --> 11:33.840
And, the culture festival was incredible!

11:33.840 --> 11:36.260
Kaname-kun was Miss Kamome Middle!

11:37.300 --> 11:38.390
Miss?

11:38.970 --> 11:40.850
You didn't have to talk about that, now, did you?

11:40.850 --> 11:43.180
The boys dressed up in girls' clothes.

11:43.180 --> 11:44.390
I'm sure the photos were...

11:44.390 --> 11:45.600
Hey, we were forced.

11:45.890 --> 11:47.810
But still, you were really pretty.

11:48.600 --> 11:50.690
I didn't want to lose since I was already doing it.

11:51.480 --> 11:52.860
I wish I saw it too.

11:52.860 --> 11:54.990
Right? See?!

11:55.280 --> 11:56.700
Two against one!

11:59.910 --> 12:02.740
Let me see... Now, where was it?

12:02.740 --> 12:04.040
Say, Mikawa.

12:05.580 --> 12:06.620
Do you remember?

12:22.760 --> 12:23.760
That's bad!

12:46.370 --> 12:49.540
You looked like a boy who had just won a fight.

12:52.380 --> 12:55.590
I'm sorry, but I can't recall.

12:56.260 --> 12:57.670
I see...

12:57.670 --> 13:01.260
Don't sweat it. You just regained consciousness and all.

13:01.260 --> 13:03.050
Take it slowly.

13:03.050 --> 13:04.390
Right, Kaname-kun?

13:05.640 --> 13:06.680
Yeah.

13:14.320 --> 13:17.610
Don't make me remember stuff like this now.

13:17.610 --> 13:19.950
What do you want me to do about it anyway?

13:20.450 --> 13:22.030
Atone for your sins.

13:23.070 --> 13:28.410
How much time, money and effort do
you think I spent to prove my innocence?

13:28.790 --> 13:30.830
This has nothing to do with the law.

13:30.830 --> 13:34.000
Only the heart can atone for sins of the heart.

13:39.130 --> 13:41.130
Come, let's go home.

13:41.130 --> 13:45.800
The other Fumika probably hasn't
returned yet, so let's head straight back...

13:48.350 --> 13:51.020
Wait, Fumika. Who do you plan on calling?

13:51.440 --> 13:54.940
I'm looking for the hospital Fumi-chan transferred to.

13:55.610 --> 14:00.820
Say, Fumika. Must you deliver that Shigofumi?

14:00.820 --> 14:01.820
I must.

14:02.320 --> 14:05.910
I like you, Fumika.

14:05.910 --> 14:09.620
Everyone laughs at me when I say that I want to be human...

14:09.620 --> 14:11.870
but you're the only one who didn't.

14:11.870 --> 14:14.210
Instead, you told me to try my best.

14:17.460 --> 14:20.380
I want to have you as my partner.

14:20.840 --> 14:22.510
For now and always.

14:23.840 --> 14:25.680
Thank you, Kanaka.

14:25.970 --> 14:27.140
Fumika.

14:29.010 --> 14:30.850
But, I have to.

14:31.810 --> 14:33.480
Because, this is my punishment.

14:33.480 --> 14:34.190
Eh?

14:36.020 --> 14:38.860
I have to accept my punishment.

14:39.650 --> 14:42.030
I'm going to walk him to the bus stop.

14:42.030 --> 14:42.740
Yeah.

14:49.620 --> 14:51.200
I have to put it back.

15:06.550 --> 15:08.930
It was from here if I remember correctly.

15:18.520 --> 15:20.320
Regarding Fumika and Fumika...

15:21.400 --> 15:24.610
Will they be happier if they returned to being one?

15:25.240 --> 15:27.740
Are you saying that it's okay for Mika to disappear?

15:27.740 --> 15:30.330
I'm asking because I don't know.

15:30.330 --> 15:31.830
Even I...

15:32.370 --> 15:34.290
Kaname! Natsuka!

15:34.710 --> 15:35.910
Kanaka?

15:36.830 --> 15:38.670
Hey, isn't that a bit conspicuous?

15:38.670 --> 15:40.000
Do you know where Fumika went?

15:40.000 --> 15:40.750
Huh?

15:41.750 --> 15:43.010
Don't tell me...

16:09.660 --> 16:10.950
I...

16:32.970 --> 16:35.020
No!

16:42.650 --> 16:46.110
Fumika!

16:48.280 --> 16:49.070
Mikawa!

16:49.700 --> 16:50.780
Where are you?

16:50.780 --> 16:53.530
She's not in her room. Where could she have gone?

16:53.530 --> 16:55.910
Both Fumikas aren't here.

17:07.420 --> 17:08.720
I...

17:13.180 --> 17:14.300
shot him!

17:20.020 --> 17:22.980
I shot Daddy!

17:26.020 --> 17:29.190
Risala, do you think we can use this rule?

17:29.190 --> 17:30.610
That won't work.

17:30.610 --> 17:33.410
It was overturned in a decree thirteen years ago.

17:34.830 --> 17:37.910
But, we might be able to use this one.

17:38.500 --> 17:39.870
Can we save her?

17:40.710 --> 17:46.380
Probably. They might approve of
her existence since she's a special case.

17:49.670 --> 17:52.300
Mika, where are you? Mika!

17:57.350 --> 18:00.180
Please come out.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.520
Mika!

18:09.650 --> 18:10.860
Fumi-chan.

18:11.740 --> 18:13.320
I understand.

18:15.990 --> 18:17.870
Mika?

18:18.660 --> 18:19.870
Mika!

18:23.620 --> 18:25.250
Mika, it's you! Mika!

18:35.760 --> 18:38.260
It's been three years, hasn't it, Fumi-chan?

18:39.390 --> 18:41.770
Forgive me, Mika.

18:41.770 --> 18:45.600
I shot Daddy.

18:46.560 --> 18:49.520
I was scared, and it was so painful...

18:50.230 --> 18:52.440
I couldn't take it any longer.

18:53.200 --> 18:53.820
That's why...

18:58.120 --> 18:59.370
Fumi-chan.

19:00.330 --> 19:02.540
I should be the one to apologise.

19:03.580 --> 19:07.750
Why? It was my fault.

19:08.840 --> 19:11.960
Because, I was the one who shot Kirameki.

19:26.350 --> 19:29.770
What are you saying? Mika.

19:30.440 --> 19:33.030
In the three years that you've been asleep...

19:33.030 --> 19:36.990
I've met many people and witnessed many lives.

19:36.990 --> 19:39.530
And I acquired many things.

19:40.410 --> 19:42.330
You did nothing wrong.

19:42.330 --> 19:45.370
The ones guilty are Kirameki and me.

19:47.080 --> 19:50.340
I did nothing wrong?

19:53.210 --> 19:55.840
Fumi-chan, shoot me...

19:57.930 --> 20:01.260
and it will be over.

20:24.660 --> 20:25.540
Fumika!

20:33.960 --> 20:37.090
Fumika, what are you doing in a place like this?

20:37.420 --> 20:41.260
I'm sorry. I thought that I might remember something...

20:41.260 --> 20:43.640
so I suddenly had the urge to walk around town.

20:43.640 --> 20:45.100
I see.

20:45.100 --> 20:45.850
Yeah.

20:46.730 --> 20:49.440
Say, did you meet anyone?

20:49.440 --> 20:50.060
That is...

20:50.440 --> 20:52.520
No, I didn't.

20:53.060 --> 20:55.070
I didn't see anyone.

21:07.000 --> 21:09.660
Sorry for making you come here.

21:09.660 --> 21:11.630
Although they call it an interrogation, it's really not...

21:11.630 --> 21:13.920
Detective, I have a request.

21:14.960 --> 21:16.210
What might it be?

21:17.260 --> 21:18.630
I'd like to press charges.

21:20.380 --> 21:25.560
I'm pressing charges against my father, Mikawa Kirameki.

21:29.140 --> 21:31.810
This time, <i>I</i> shall be the one who fires.

21:53.170 --> 21:58.000
Shigofumi

21:53.170 --> 21:58.000
Episode Eleven

21:53.170 --> 21:58.000
Awakening

23:28.720 --> 23:32.060
The will to step forward; that's courage.

23:32.060 --> 23:35.140
Untapped possibilities; that's the future.

23:35.730 --> 23:38.100
Two futures begin to advance.

23:38.980 --> 23:40.520
Next time on Shigofumi:

23:41.230 --> 23:42.690
Shigofumi.

23:41.230 --> 23:43.230
Episode Twelve
